      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i noticed in the senator's part you had him call the activist's views \"politically convenient privacy dogma.\" that's a pretty strong way to phrase it. was that just part of the character's personality, or do you think that's actually a more accurate way to describe the opposition's stance in a debate like this?",
